cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ARTEX in research or commercial work, please cite it as below."
title: "ARTEX: Autonomous AI Penetration Testing & Offensive Security Platform"
abstract: >-
  ARTEX is an LLM-driven autonomous penetration-testing platform. It models an
  engagement as a live exploration DAG, dispatches parallel worker intents,
  records HTTP/HTTPS traffic as hash-addressed evidence, and generates
  reproducible, artifact-rich technical reports.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ARTEX Project"
    website: "https://github.com/Autumn-27/artex"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Autumn-27/artex"
url: "https://github.com/Autumn-27/artex"
version: "2.4.0"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
keywords:
  - penetration testing
  - offensive security
  - autonomous agents
  - large language models
  - vulnerability assessment
